---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Delete your PaddleToday account | Paddle Today" description="Request deletion of a PaddleToday mobile account and its synced personal data.">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Account</p>
    <h1>Delete your account</h1>
    <p class="muted">You can delete an account from the mobile app under More → Account &amp; backup → Delete account.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="info-panel">
    <h2>Cannot open the app?</h2>
    <p class="muted">Email <a href="mailto:hello@paddletoday.com?subject=PaddleToday%20account%20deletion%20request">hello@paddletoday.com</a> from the email address on your account. Ask us to delete your PaddleToday account and synced personal data. We will verify account ownership before processing the request.</p>
    <p class="muted">Please do not send passwords, sign-in links, or provider security codes. Synced saved routes, notes, and trip plans are deleted from the active account store. Any restricted recovery copies follow the hosting provider's retention schedule. Existing email or push alerts are managed separately through their existing unsubscribe controls.</p>
    <p><a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
